  "body": "This PR add support for the latest LoRa radio, LR2021. It is currently in public preview in this branch. Once the features listed below are implemented, it will be merged into master.\r\n\r\n- [x] Basic Tx+Rx over LoRa in UHF band\r\n- [x] Support for >1 GHz bands\r\n- [x] Support for GFSK modem\r\n- [x] Support for LR-FHSS modem\r\n- [x] Support for FLRC modem\r\n- [x] Support for OOK modem\r\n- [x] Multi-SF reception\r\n- [x] Add examples\r\n- [x] Update readme and tags\r\n- [x] LoRaWAN tested\r\n\r\nCloses #1457 ",
